Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue Resolution Guide
Problem: Host Shows "Non Operational" Status
Solution Steps:

Check VDSM service status:
systemctl status vdsmd
systemctl restart vdsmd
Verify network connectivity:
ping rhvm-server-ip
telnet rhvm-server-ip 443
Check firewall configuration:
firewall-cmd --list-all
Problem: Registration Fails with SSH Errors
Solution Steps:

Verify SSH service:
systemctl status sshd
systemctl restart sshd
Check SSH configuration:
grep -E "PermitRootLogin|PasswordAuthentication" /etc/ssh/sshd_config
Test SSH connectivity:
ssh -v root@rhvh-host-ip
Problem: Certificate Verification Failures
Solution Steps:

Regenerate certificates:
rm -rf /etc/pki/vdsm/certs/*
systemctl restart vdsmd
Update CA certificates:
update-ca-trust
